<title>ITALY: IFI sees 1996 profits in line with 1995.</title>
<headline>IFI sees 1996 profits in line with 1995.</headline>
<dateline>TURIN, Italy 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian financial holding company IFI said on Wednesday that its 1996 net consolidated profits are in line with the 411 billion lire seen in 1995.</p>
<p>At the parent company level, IFI SpA saw net profits up 50 percent at 80 billion lire, a company statement said.</p>
